      "description": "Kept a 1-land hand in Limited. With only Mountain and all 3+ CMC spells, the player needs to draw lands on consecutive turns to function. The probability of being mana-screwed is very high (~60%+ chance of missing a land drop in the first 2-3 draw steps).",
